     "body": "<p>I did a git bisect and resolved that the first commit to cause this error was a dependabot PR bumping the Shiro version </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2071\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2071</a> </p>\n\n<p>Looking into Shiro I found this issue <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/shiro/issues/1025\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/apache/shiro/issues/1025</a></p>",
